    "body": "### Problem\n\nThe compilation failed with the latest commit, HEAD-0ea627c.\n\nThere is something wrong with tree-sitter-c. The last time I successfully compiled Neovim was last Friday, the 18th.\n\n```bash\n❯ brew install neovim --HEAD\n==> Would install 1 formula:\nneovim HEAD_1\n==> Fetching downloads for: neovim\n✔︎ API Source neovim.rb                                                                                                                                                                                                            Verified      7.1KB/  7.1KB\n✔︎ Formula neovim (HEAD-0ea627c)\n==> Downloading https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-c/archive/v0.24.2.tar.gz\ncurl: (6) Could not resolve host: github.com\nWarning: Problem : timeout. Will retry in 1 seconds. 3 retries left.\ncurl: (6) Could not resolve host: github.com\nWarning: Problem : timeout. Will retry in 2 seconds. 2 retries left.\ncurl: (6) Could not resolve host: github.com\nWarning: Problem : timeout. Will retry in 4 seconds. 1 retries left.\ncurl: (6) Could not resolve host: github.com\n\nError: neovim: An exception occurred within a child process:\n  DownloadError: Failed to download resource \"treesitter-c\"\nDownload failed: https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-c/archive/v0.24.2.tar.gz\ncurl: (6) Could not resolve host: github.com\nWarning: Problem : timeout. Will retry in 1 seconds. 3 retries left.\ncurl: (6) Could not resolve host: github.com\nWarning: Problem : timeout. Will retry in 2 seconds. 2 retries left.\ncurl: (6) Could not resolve host: github.com\nWarning: Problem : timeout. Will retry in 4 seconds. 1 retries left.\ncurl: (6) Could not resolve host: github.com\n```\n\nIf I click the downloading URL or ping github.com, all is ok.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nbrew install neovim --HEAD\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nNo errors when downloading tree-sitter-c\n\n### Nvim version (nvim -v)\n\nLatest HEAD-0ea627c\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nno\n\n### Operating system/version\n\nmacOS 27\n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nwezterm\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nxterm-256color\n\n### Installation\n\nbrew install neovim --HEAD",
